ang Jie and Sophia Rodriguez are in the Product/UX department. Priya Sharma is in the documentation department. \\n\\n\\n\\n\\n[ \\\\\\\\[KaTeX\\\\\\\\] ](https://khan.github.io/KaTeX/function-support.html)\\n', url='http://the-agent-company.com:3000/direct/CZYWHd5bCmhj5YcFeRGZyENbrjkxjosMCH', trigger_by_action='browse_interactive', screenshot_path='/outputs/.browser_screenshots/screenshot_20251107_175158_906908.png', error=False, observation=<ObservationType.BROWSE: 'browse'>, goal_image_urls=[], open_pages_urls=['http://the-agent-company.com:3000/direct/CZYWHd5bCmhj5YcFeRGZyENbrjkxjosMCH'], active_page_index=0, last_browser_action=\"\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\npress('1416', 'Enter')\\nnoop(3000)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\", last_browser_action_error='', focused_element_bid='1416'), IPythonRunCellAction(code='\\nimport pandas as pd\\nimport numpy as np\\nfrom datetime import datetime\\n\\n# Read the CSV file\\ndf = pd.read_csv(\\'/workspace/april-attendance-data.csv\\')\\n\\n# Display the first few rows to understand the data\\nprint(\"First few rows of the data:\")\\nprint(df.head())\\nprint(\"\\\\nData shape:\", df.shape)\\n', thought=\"Perfect! Mark Johnson has responded with the department information:\\n\\n- Product/UX department: Huang Jie and Sophia Rodriguez\\n- Documentation department: Priya Sharma\\n\\nNow I have collected all the department information I need. Let me summarize what I've learned:\\n\\n1. **Finance department**: David Wong\\n2. **Technical department**: Sarah Johnson, Li Ming, Zhang Wei, Wang Fang, Mike Chen, Emily Zhou, Liu Qiang, Alex Turner, Emma Lewis, and Jessica Chen\\n3. **HR department**: Chen Xinyi\\n4. **Sales/Marketing department**: Mark Johnson and Jessica Lee\\n5. **Product/UX department**: Huang Jie and Sophia Rodriguez\\n6. **Documentation department**: Priya Sharma\\n\\nNow I need to process the attendance data and create the report. Let me write a Python script to analyze the atte